ounty","/arc-plc/wisconsin/jackson-county"],["PRF calculator","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record for Jackson County runs from 1951 to 2025, and on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 10 grids January to February came in under 90% of normal in 35 of 75 years. In 2025 the middle of the grids got 39% of normal in January to February and 160% of normal in March to April. Grid 28956 had its driest year in 1976 at 58% of normal.</p>"}
